Subject: legend for geom_errorbar
Message-ID: <vDxuB8Qskc4.USIsnAvvPGwJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/vDxuB8Qskc4/m/USIsnAvvPGwJ>
